  "transformedHtml": "<article class=\"legal-article\" id=\"art-3\">\n  <header class=\"article-header\">\n    <h2 class=\"article-number\">Article 3</h2>\n  </header>\n  <div class=\"article-content\">\n    <div class=\"article-text\">\n      <p class=\"intro-text\">A l'article 1er, c), de l'arrêté royal du 10 août 2001 fixant les jours et heures d'ouverture des greffes des cours et tribunaux, modifié en dernier lieu par l'arrêté royal du 18 juillet 2017, les modifications suivantes sont apportées :</p>\n      <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"a)\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">le </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"1°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">est abrogé</span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"b)\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">les </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"24°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">et</span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"25°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">sont abrogés</span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"c)\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">le </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"26°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">est remplacé comme suit : \"</span>\n              <span class=\"provision-text-quoted\">26° des greffes des sièges de Couvin et de Florennes de la justice de paix de Philippeville qui sont ouverts tous les jours ouvrables de 8 h 30 m à 12 h 30 m</span>\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">\"</span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">;</span>\n        </li>\n        <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"d)\">\n          <span class=\"provision-text\">les </span>\n          <ol class=\"numbered-provisions\">\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"27°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">, </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"32°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">et </span>\n            </li>\n            <li class=\"provision\" data-number=\"37°\">\n              <span class=\"provision-text\">sont abrogés.</span>\n            </li>\n          </ol>\n        </li>\n      </ol>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</article>",
